  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "MovieGuys",
      "content": "\"Prisoner of War\" is a basic war movie with a martial arts theme that expands upon the antagonism and martial competition between a Western prisoner of war and his Japanese jailers. \r\n\r\nI felt this film could have built upon the core concept of a sort of camp kumite (martial arts tournament) but instead it leads into a watered down great escape scenario. \r\n\r\nActing is reasonable and action is mostly well done. \r\n\r\nIn summary, a basic war, martial arts film. Worth a look.",
      "rating": 6,
      "createdAt": "2025-09-22T06:08:54Z"
    }
  ],
